{
  "schema": "l4-go/surface-map@1",
  "subject": "regcf",
  "note": [
    "THE IDENTITY MAP — a fixture, not a G2 artifact.",
    "",
    "Both sides name the same module, and every pair maps a decision onto itself.",
    "It exists so the diff oracle can be shown to be honest in the only two ways",
    "that matter: over this map it must report 100% agreement and zero",
    "divergences (self-test A), and when one threshold constant in a COPY of the",
    "module is moved, it must catch that and nothing else (self-test B).",
    "",
    "A real G2 surface map has two different modules on the two sides, and its",
    "`right` side carries `rename` entries wherever the de novo encoding chose",
    "different field names. Nothing else about the shape changes.",
    "",
    "Coverage is deliberately partial: 13 of the corpus's 100 declared rules.",
    "The pairs chosen are the ones the Lexipedia page's eight requirement groups",
    "actually answer, plus the two intermediate figures (aggregate offering",
    "amount, investment limit) whose divergence would otherwise hide inside a",
    "boolean. The `supplied` and `annual_cycles` context entries of the cases",
    "file are not modelled: `supplied` is an enum-valued FinancialStatementRequirement",
    "and `annual_cycles` only feeds a regulative rule, which this oracle does not",
    "reach (see the Limits section of any report it writes). The `filing` slot and",
    "the `disclosure requirements are met` pair are also out, for a third reason",
    "worth stating: FormCFiling carries an enum-typed field (`the financial",
    "statements supplied` IS A FinancialStatementRequirement) and JSONDECODE",
    "delivers a constructor name as a ValString, so every CONSIDER over it raises",
    "NonExhaustivePatterns. Both sides raise it identically, so the pair would have",
    "read as 14 agreements that measure nothing. Measured 2026-08-02; the same",
    "limit applies to `l4 batch`, which decodes rows the same way."
  ],
  "sides": {
